    "description": "Tired of a monotonous life? Want to share your passions with people around the world? Habi is your ideal choice!\r\nHabi is a new social platform focused on sharing hobbies and making friends. With our diverse features, you can easily find like-minded friends and interact with them in real-time!\r\nMain Features of Habi:\r\nVideo Chat\r\nPrivately communicate with friends who share your interests.\r\nMultilingual Support\r\nBreak down language barriers and chat effortlessly.\r\nPrivacy-Safe Video Calls\r\nEnsure your conversations are secure and worry-free.\r\nDownload Habi now to explore interests and make friends globally!",
